  "_comment": "Maps ingredient keywords (lowercase) to a major allergen category. At request time the server lowercases an item's ingredient string and matches each keyword on word boundaries (so 'eggplant' does not match 'egg'). Categories are deduplicated, so an item containing both 'milk' and 'cheese' reports 'dairy' once. Keyword set grounded in BU dining ingredient data plus standard FDA/EU major allergens. Note: nutmeg (a spice, not a tree nut) and oats (naturally gluten-free) are intentionally excluded to avoid false positives.",

